sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant Local as Browser / OS cache + hosts
    participant DNS as Recursive DNS resolver
    participant Web as Server / edge proxy
    User->>Browser: Open https://example.com/path?q=1
    Browser->>Local: Resolve hostname
    alt Cache or hosts entry exists
        Local-->>Browser: Cached address
    else Needs DNS answer
        Local->>DNS: Query A / AAAA
        DNS-->>Local: Address + TTL (or negative answer)
        Local-->>Browser: Address
    end
    Browser->>Web: Open transport to destination port 443
    Browser->>Web: TLS ClientHello with SNI
    Web-->>Browser: Certificate + handshake messages
    Browser->>Browser: Validate hostname and trusted certificate chain
    Browser->>Web: Send encrypted HTTP request
    Web-->>Browser: HTTP response (200 or 3xx Location)
    opt Redirect to another hostname
        Browser->>Local: Resolve new hostname if needed
        Browser->>Web: Open/reuse connection and repeat applicable phases
    end
